Catppuccin Palette
------------------
Colour values are generated from the Catppuccin palette at a pinned revision.

  Source:   https://github.com/catppuccin/palette
  File:     palette.json
  Revision: 07d02aa110ef9eb7e7427afca5c73ba9cf7f8ebd
  License:  MIT

Generated theme resources are derived values. Where a raw palette colour did
not meet the contrast requirements of PLAN.md section 5, a darkened variant is
generated; hue is preserved and the origin colour is recorded in the generated
file.


Inter (font)
------------
Inter is embedded via the Avalonia.Fonts.Inter package and shipped inside
SaveEditor.Ui. Embedding is required for deterministic rendering: Inter is not
present on a default Ubuntu image, and a name-resolved default would silently
fall back and invalidate the screenshot baseline.

  Source:  https://github.com/rsms/inter
  License: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL-1.1)

The OFL requires that this notice accompany the font. The full licence text is
distributed with the Avalonia.Fonts.Inter package.


